{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/list-group/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"List group","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"List groups are a flexible and powerful component for displaying a series of content. Modify and extend them to support just about any content within."},"blocks":[{"id":"basic-example","type":"heading","en":"Basic example","level":2},{"id":"basic-example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The most basic list group is an unordered list with list items and the proper classes. Build upon it with the options that follow, or with your own CSS as needed."},{"id":"basic-example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ed04b919948b8678a081","height":260},{"id":"basic-example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A fourth item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">And a fifth one</li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"active-items","type":"heading","en":"Active items","level":2},{"id":"active-items--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.active</code> to a <code>.list-group-item</code> to indicate the current active selection."},{"id":"active-items--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0efee592a269bde0e76f","height":260},{"id":"active-items--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item active\" aria-current=\"true\">An active item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A fourth item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">And a fifth one</li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"links-and-buttons","type":"heading","en":"Links and buttons","level":2},{"id":"links-and-buttons--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>s or <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>s to create <em>actionable</em> list group items with hover, disabled, and active states by adding <code>.list-group-item-action</code>. We separate these pseudo-classes to ensure list groups made of non-interactive elements (like <code>&lt;li&gt;</code>s or <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>s) don’t provide a click or tap affordance."},{"id":"links-and-buttons--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Make <code>.list-group-item-action</code> instances <em>appear</em> disabled by adding <code>.disabled</code>, and <code>aria-disabled=&quot;true&quot;</code> to inform assistive technologies that the element is disabled. You may require additional JavaScript to fully disable links and buttons."},{"id":"links-and-buttons--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Be sure to <strong>not use the standard <code>.btn</code> classes here</strong>."},{"id":"links-and-buttons--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3d353d4b4ee69394075b","height":260},{"id":"links-and-buttons--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action active\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    The current link item\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A second link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A third link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A fourth link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">A disabled link item</a>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"links-and-buttons--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"With <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>s, you can also make use of the <code>disabled</code> attribute instead of the <code>.disabled</code> class. Sadly, <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>s don’t support the disabled attribute."},{"id":"links-and-buttons--example-2","type":"demo","key":"f180533ed293e62bdf8c","height":260},{"id":"links-and-buttons--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action active\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    The current button\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A second button item</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A third button item</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A fourth button item</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\" disabled>A disabled button item</button>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"flush","type":"heading","en":"Flush","level":2},{"id":"flush--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.list-group-flush</code> to remove some borders and rounded corners to render list group items edge-to-edge in a parent container (e.g., cards)."},{"id":"flush--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9d8005d6124676b0adc1","height":260},{"id":"flush--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A fourth item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">And a fifth one</li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"numbered","type":"heading","en":"Numbered","level":2},{"id":"numbered--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>.list-group-numbered</code> modifier class (and optionally use an <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> element) to opt into numbered list group items. Numbers are generated via CSS (as opposed to a <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>s default browser styling) for better placement inside list group items and to allow for better customization."},{"id":"numbered--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Numbers are generated by <code>counter-reset</code> on the <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>, and then styled and placed with a <code>::before</code> pseudo-element on the <code>&lt;li&gt;</code> with <code>counter-increment</code> and <code>content</code>."},{"id":"numbered--example-1","type":"demo","key":"32e9be16f162442b8da1","height":260},{"id":"numbered--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"list-group list-group-numbered\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A list item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A list item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A list item</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"numbered--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"These work great with custom content as well."},{"id":"numbered--example-2","type":"demo","key":"6b6da2169b17ffcbb706","height":260},{"id":"numbered--code-2","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"list-group list-group-numbered\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"ms-2 me-auto\">\n      <div class=\"fw-bold\">Subheading</div>\n      Content for list item\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">14</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"ms-2 me-auto\">\n      <div class=\"fw-bold\">Subheading</div>\n      Content for list item\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">14</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"ms-2 me-auto\">\n      <div class=\"fw-bold\">Subheading</div>\n      Content for list item\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">14</span>\n  </li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal","type":"heading","en":"Horizontal","level":2},{"id":"horizontal--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.list-group-horizontal</code> to change the layout of list group items from vertical to horizontal across all container sizes. Alternatively, choose a responsive variant <code>.{sm|md|lg|xl|2xl}:list-group-horizontal</code> to make a list group horizontal starting at that breakpoint’s width."},{"id":"horizontal--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The responsive variants use <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/layout/breakpoints#container-queries\">container queries</a>, so wrap the list group in a query container—add the <code>.contains-inline</code> utility to a parent element—for them to take effect. Currently <strong>horizontal list groups cannot be combined with flush list groups.</strong>"},{"id":"horizontal--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<strong>ProTip:</strong> Want equal-width list group items when horizontal? Add <code>.flex-fill</code> to each list group item."},{"id":"horizontal--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7a5d874d927d4a556486","height":300},{"id":"horizontal--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group sm:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group md:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group lg:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group xl:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group 2xl:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Drag the handle to resize the container below and watch the list group switch between vertical and horizontal layouts as the container—not the viewport—crosses the <code>md</code> breakpoint."},{"id":"horizontal--example-2","type":"demo","key":"0f0fa3228d30a297a7c0","height":260},{"id":"horizontal--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group md:list-group-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"variants","type":"heading","en":"Variants","level":2},{"id":"variants--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use contextual classes to style list items with a stateful background and color."},{"id":"variants--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8ca610227d2f5648f125","height":260},{"id":"variants--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A simple default list group item</li>\n  \n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-primary\">A simple primary list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-accent\">A simple accent list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-success\">A simple success list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-danger\">A simple danger list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-warning\">A simple warning list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-info\">A simple info list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-inverse\">A simple inverse list group item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item theme-secondary\">A simple secondary list group item</li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons","type":"heading","en":"For links and buttons","level":3},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Contextual classes also work with <code>.list-group-item-action</code> for <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> elements. Note the addition of the hover styles here not present in the previous example. Also supported is the <code>.active</code> state; apply it to indicate an active selection on a contextual list group item."},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons--example-1","type":"demo","key":"cb4124b2a319c48e463c","height":260},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A simple default list group item</a>\n  \n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-primary\">A simple primary list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-accent\">A simple accent list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-success\">A simple success list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-danger\">A simple danger list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-warning\">A simple warning list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-info\">A simple info list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-inverse\">A simple inverse list group item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action theme-secondary\">A simple secondary list group item</a>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Accessibility Tip: Using color to convey meaning"},{"id":"for-links-and-buttons--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. Please ensure the meaning is obvious from the content itself (e.g., the visible text with a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>sufficient</em> color contrast</a>) or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."},{"id":"with-badges","type":"heading","en":"With badges","level":2},{"id":"with-badges--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add badges to any list group item to show unread counts, activity, and more with the help of some <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/flex\">utilities</a>."},{"id":"with-badges--example-1","type":"demo","key":"365075d984ae6ab81853","height":260},{"id":"with-badges--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    A list item\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">14</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    A second list item\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">2</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    A third list item\n    <span class=\"badge theme-primary\">1</span>\n  </li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"custom-content","type":"heading","en":"Custom content","level":2},{"id":"custom-content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add nearly any HTML within, even for linked list groups like the one below, with the help of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/flex\">flexbox utilities</a>."},{"id":"custom-content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"67a82d5c664ea4bd0d57","height":260},{"id":"custom-content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action active\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"d-flex w-100 justify-content-between\">\n      <h5 class=\"mb-1\">List group item heading</h5>\n      <small>3 days ago</small>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mb-1\">Some placeholder content in a paragraph.</p>\n    <small>And some small print.</small>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">\n    <div class=\"d-flex w-100 justify-content-between\">\n      <h5 class=\"mb-1\">List group item heading</h5>\n      <small class=\"fg-2\">3 days ago</small>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mb-1\">Some placeholder content in a paragraph.</p>\n    <small class=\"fg-2\">And some muted small print.</small>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">\n    <div class=\"d-flex w-100 justify-content-between\">\n      <h5 class=\"mb-1\">List group item heading</h5>\n      <small class=\"fg-2\">3 days ago</small>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mb-1\">Some placeholder content in a paragraph.</p>\n    <small class=\"fg-2\">And some muted small print.</small>\n  </a>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios","type":"heading","en":"Checkboxes and radios","level":2},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Place Bootstrap’s checkboxes and radios within list group items and customize as needed. You can use them without <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s, but please remember to include an <code>aria-label</code> attribute and value for accessibility."},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--example-1","type":"demo","key":"027c1abfdf9d6d868d5e","height":260,"anchors":["firstCheckbox","secondCheckbox","thirdCheckbox"]},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"firstCheckbox\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"firstCheckbox\">First checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"secondCheckbox\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"secondCheckbox\">Second checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"thirdCheckbox\" class=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"thirdCheckbox\">Third checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--example-2","type":"demo","key":"c12c8a5aa06b80092f22","height":260,"anchors":["firstRadio","secondRadio","thirdRadio"]},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--code-2","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"listGroupRadio\" value=\"\" id=\"firstRadio\" class=\"radio\" checked>\n      <label for=\"firstRadio\">First radio</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"listGroupRadio\" value=\"\" id=\"secondRadio\" class=\"radio\">\n      <label for=\"secondRadio\">Second radio</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"listGroupRadio\" value=\"\" id=\"thirdRadio\" class=\"radio\">\n      <label for=\"thirdRadio\">Third radio</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can use <code>.stretched-link</code> on <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s to make the whole list group item clickable."},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--example-3","type":"demo","key":"2269684d1ac4b02f1389","height":260,"anchors":["firstCheckboxStretched","secondCheckboxStretched","thirdCheckboxStretched"]},{"id":"checkboxes-and-radios--code-3","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"firstCheckboxStretched\" class=\"check\">\n      <label class=\"stretched-link\" for=\"firstCheckboxStretched\">First checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"secondCheckboxStretched\" class=\"check\">\n      <label class=\"stretched-link\" for=\"secondCheckboxStretched\">Second checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">\n    <div class=\"form-field\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\" id=\"thirdCheckboxStretched\" class=\"check\">\n      <label class=\"stretched-link\" for=\"thirdCheckboxStretched\">Third checkbox</label>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"List groups use local CSS variables on <code>.list-group</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$list-group-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --list-group-color: var(--fg-body),\n    --list-group-bg: var(--bg-body),\n    --list-group-border-color: var(--border-color),\n    --list-group-border-width: var(--border-width),\n    --list-group-border-radius: var(--radius-5),\n    --list-group-item-padding-x: var(--spacer),\n    --list-group-item-padding-y: var(--spacer-2),\n    --list-group-action-color: var(--fg-2),\n    --list-group-action-hover-color: var(--fg-1),\n    --list-group-action-hover-bg: var(--bg-1),\n    --list-group-action-active-color: var(--fg-body),\n    --list-group-action-active-bg: var(--bg-2),\n    --list-group-disabled-color: var(--fg-3),\n    --list-group-disabled-bg: var(--bg-body),\n    --list-group-active-color: var(--primary-contrast),\n    --list-group-active-bg: var(--primary-bg),\n    --list-group-active-border-color: var(--primary-bg),\n  ),\n  $list-group-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"javascript-behavior","type":"heading","en":"JavaScript behavior","level":2},{"id":"javascript-behavior--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/components/tab#list-groups\">Tab plugin</a> to create tabbable list group panes."}],"demos":[{"key":"ed04b919948b8678a081","html":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">An item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A fourth item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">And a fifth one</li>\n</ul>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0efee592a269bde0e76f","html":"<ul class=\"list-group\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item active\" aria-current=\"true\">An active item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A second item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A third item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">A fourth item</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">And a fifth one</li>\n</ul>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3d353d4b4ee69394075b","html":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action active\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    The current link item\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A second link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A third link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">A fourth link item</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">A disabled link item</a>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"f180533ed293e62bdf8c","html":"<div class=\"list-group\">\n  <button type=\"button